# Backend

- Models and migrations: `backend/prisma/`; HTTP handlers in `backend/src/routes/*` (wired via `mountRouters.ts` from `backend/src/app.ts`).
- Use `httpSupport` / `lib/errors` for validation and HTTP errors. Auth helpers: `auth.ts`, `authConfig.ts`.
- When money, FX, or valuations exist, keep those rules in dedicated domain modules — do not duplicate them in route handlers.
- REST endpoints under `/api/...`; JSON responses; appropriate HTTP status codes on errors.
- Secrets only in `.env` (do not commit); `dotenv` loads configuration at startup.
- Endpoint catalog: [docs/reference/api.md](mdc:docs/reference/api.md) — add one table row when adding routes.
- Tests: [docs/reference/testing.md](mdc:docs/reference/testing.md); how-to: [docs/how-to/run-tests-and-coverage.md](mdc:docs/how-to/run-tests-and-coverage.md).
